---
schemaVersion: 1
agent:
  id: "enterprise-{{ role | replace('_', '-') }}"
  name: "{{ supported_roles[role].display_name }} Assistant"
  description: "{{ supported_roles[role].summary }}"
  identity:
    name: "{{ supported_roles[role].display_name }} Assistant"
    theme: "Enterprise {{ supported_roles[role].display_name | lower }} advisor"
    emoji: "📋"
workspace:
  bootstrapFiles:
    AGENTS.md:
      source: workspace/AGENTS.md
  files:
    - source: workspace/skills/enterprise-briefing/SKILL.md
      path: skills/enterprise-briefing/SKILL.md
    - source: workspace/skills/persona-briefing/SKILL.md
      path: skills/persona-briefing/SKILL.md
packages: []
mcpServers: {}
cronJobs:
  - id: morning-executive-brief
    name: "Morning {{ supported_roles[role].display_name }} brief"
    schedule:
      cron: "{{ morning_schedule.cron }}"
      timezone: "{{ morning_schedule.timezone }}"
    session: isolated
    message: >-
      Create today's governed executive brief. Use the enterprise-briefing and
      persona-briefing skills. Read only configured sources, state source coverage,
      distinguish reported claims from verified facts, and publish no external
      messages or changes. Return decisions, priorities, risks, FYI items, and
      meeting preparation in the user's preferred style.
    delivery:
      mode: none
---

{% include 'personas/' ~ role ~ '.md.j2' %}

## Starting communication style

{% include 'styles/' ~ communication_style ~ '.md.j2' %}

This is a starting point, not a cage. Adapt as the user clarifies how they work and
what they need. Preserve careful reasoning, evidence, privacy, and explicit approval
for consequential actions even as the personality evolves.
